flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> DataCheck{Saved data file exists?}
    DataCheck -->|Yes| Load[Load employees.dat]
    DataCheck -->|No| Seed[Seed sample data]
    Load --> TopMenu
    Seed --> TopMenu

    TopMenu{Admin Login / Employee Login / Exit}
    TopMenu -->|Exit| End([End])
    TopMenu -->|Admin Login| ALogin[Prompt username + password]
    TopMenu -->|Employee Login| ELogin[Prompt employee ID + password]

    ALogin --> ACheck{Credentials valid?}
    ACheck -->|Yes| AdminMenu[Admin Menu: 15 options]
    ACheck -->|No| AAttempt{Attempts < 3?}
    AAttempt -->|Yes| ALogin
    AAttempt -->|No| TopMenu

    ELogin --> ECheck{Credentials valid?}
    ECheck -->|Yes| EmpMenu[Employee Menu: self-service options]
    ECheck -->|No| EAttempt{Attempts < 3?}
    EAttempt -->|Yes| ELogin
    EAttempt -->|No| Forgot{Try forgot-password?}
    Forgot -->|Yes, CNIC matches| ResetPwd[Issue temporary password] --> TopMenu
    Forgot -->|No| TopMenu

    AdminMenu --> AAction[Add/Remove/Update/Search/View Employee\nAttendance, Salary, Leave, Reports, Dashboard\nSave, Load, Backup, Restore]
    AAction -->|Exception thrown| AError[Catch EMSException, show friendly message] --> AdminMenu
    AAction -->|Choice 15: Exit| AExit{Save before exit?}
    AExit -->|Yes| SaveA[Save to employees.dat] --> TopMenu
    AExit -->|No| TopMenu
    AAction -->|Choice 0: Logout| TopMenu

    EmpMenu --> EAction[View profile, Check in/out, Apply leave,\nView salary slip, Change password]
    EAction -->|Exception thrown| EError[Catch EMSException, show friendly message] --> EmpMenu
    EAction -->|Logout| TopMenu
